	<names>
		<name lang="en">CU1128 EtherCAT junction, realistic view</name>
		<name lang="fr">CU1128 jonction EtherCAT, vue réaliste</name>
	</names>
	<elementInformations>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Beckhoff</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">CU1128</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">EtherCAT junction, 8 x RJ45</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">EtherCAT junction with eight RJ45 sockets (100BASE-TX): port 1 is the input from the master, ports 2 to 8 are outputs. Supply 24 V DC (18 to 30 V) on a three-pin connector: 1 +24 V, 2 0 V, 3 PE. One link/activity LED per socket. No E-bus and no power contact. The position of the sockets (two rows of four), of the supply terminals and of the LEDs is assumed.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
	<informations>Author: QElectroTech contributors
Generic layout, drawn from the public description of the product, not copied from a manufacturer drawing. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license
Realistic view made by misc/beckhoff/gen_hubs.py: scale 3.125 px per mm, grid 5 px. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license</informations>
